Lemma tokit_ctor_post_c : forall ra sp gp tp s0 s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 F fc A Fi La W wbs m,
  tokit_ctor_post ra sp gp tp s0 s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 F fc A Fi La W wbs m
  = tokit_post_c (tokit_cells_after (tok_next false (tok_suffix W Fi wbs)) Fi La) ra sp gp tp s0 s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11 F fc A W wbs m.
Proof. intros. reflexivity. Qed.

